<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>操作系统 on Minghan的博客</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/categories/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/</link><description>Recent content in 操作系统 on Minghan的博客</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 21:36:30 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Jiangmmh.github.io/categories/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>从目标文件到运行时装载：深入理解链接</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/link/</link><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 21:36:30 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/link/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="1-链接的历史为什么需要链接器">1. 链接的历史：为什么需要链接器？&lt;/h2>
&lt;h3 id="11-从一个源文件到一个完整的程序">1.1 从一个源文件到一个完整的程序&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>当我们编写一个 C 程序时，通常会经历以下过程：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">源代码
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> │
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ▼
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">预处理（Preprocessing）
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> │
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ▼
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">编译（Compilation）
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> │
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ▼
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">汇编（Assembly）
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> │
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ▼
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">目标文件（Object File）
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> │
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ▼
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">链接（Linking）
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> │
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ▼
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">可执行文件（Executable）
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> │
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ▼
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">装载与执行（Loading &amp;amp; Execution）
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>初学编程时，我们可能会认为，编译器只需要把源代码翻译成机器指令，再将这些指令交给处理器执行即可。但当软件规模扩大到数十万行、数百万行甚至更多时，问题就变得复杂起来。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>假设我们有这样一个程序：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-c" data-lang="c">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">// main.c
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="cp">#include&lt;/span> &lt;span class="cpf">&amp;lt;stdio.h&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cp">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="cp">&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">add&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">b&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">main&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">result&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">add&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">10&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">20&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">printf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;%d&lt;/span>&lt;span class="se">\n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">result&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>函数 &lt;code>add()&lt;/code> 的实现位于另一个文件：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-c" data-lang="c">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">// add.c
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">add&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">b&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">a&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">b&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>我们可以分别编译这两个源文件：&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Unix/Linux 进程间通信</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/unix-linux-ipc/</link><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:33:34 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/unix-linux-ipc/</guid><description>深入理解 Unix/Linux 进程间通信机制，涵盖文件描述符、fork、管道、socketpair、Unix Domain Socket、TCP/UDP Socket、数据传输语义、错误处理与实战示例。</description></item></channel></rss>